<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Locked</Major>
    <Description>Ace eater and surf tackle for instant steals for the game Locked on Roblox.
I suggest using a 0.2 sens with 1820x1900.
thanks to this macro u can steal the ball from your opponents without having to rotate on your own and it gives iframes :D
btw have fun !!!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 21 1
MoveTo 564 465
MoveR 319 -125
RightDown 1
Delay 64
RightUp 1
KeyUp 21 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>